OL,3,GNEWSAConcerns as 275 more homes planned
OL,4,Afor market town
OL,5,
OL,6,FShropshire Council said it recognised
OL,7,Fthe number of concerns from residents
OL,8,Fand that a decision had not yet been
OL,9,Fmade on the plans.
